1
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,530
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,700
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,530
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,710
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,270
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,070
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,940
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,410
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,760
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,680
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:49,010
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,860
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,380
=Episode 5=

15
00:01:04,510 --> 00:01:05,590
It's a high-grade Dao Bone,

16
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,200
and he just crushed it!

17
00:01:08,590 --> 00:01:09,840
He could've given it to me!

18
00:01:10,230 --> 00:01:11,000
That's not all.

19
00:01:11,430 --> 00:01:13,230
He even embarrassed
the Holy Maiden in public.

20
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:15,070
He completely ignored her advances.

21
00:01:15,510 --> 00:01:17,710
He... he must've lost his mind.

22
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:23,510
(Classic Zhao Feiyang.)

23
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,840
(What a thick skull!)

24
00:01:25,790 --> 00:01:27,790
That fool actually turned her down.

25
00:01:28,790 --> 00:01:29,590
Interesting.

26
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,350
Zhao Feiyang,

27
00:01:30,710 --> 00:01:31,840
you've got some nerve!

28
00:01:32,590 --> 00:01:34,150
How dare you do something like this?

29
00:01:34,790 --> 00:01:36,310
Do you know how precious

30
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,870
a high-grade Dao Bone is?

31
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:40,150
You just destroyed it?

32
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,710
Didn't you hear her?

33
00:01:42,590 --> 00:01:43,840
It was mine to begin with.

34
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:46,040
I'll do whatever I want with it.

35
00:01:46,310 --> 00:01:46,760
You...

36
00:01:48,310 --> 00:01:48,950
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
Zhao Feiyang,

37
00:01:49,510 --> 00:01:50,310
what's with that attitude?

38
00:01:50,430 --> 00:01:51,590
How do you expect me to act?

39
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:53,480
Be grateful or flatter you?

40
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,950
Do you really intend
to be this heartless?

41
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:58,200
Do you really think

42
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:58,710
I'm that desperate for you?

43
00:01:58,790 --> 00:01:59,710
Then tell me,

44
00:01:59,950 --> 00:02:00,710
Chen Qiushui.

45
00:02:02,070 --> 00:02:03,310
Who do you think you are?

46
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:10,870
Is the Holy Maiden in tears?

47
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:13,120
Qiushui,

48
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,000
do you want me

49
00:02:16,190 --> 00:02:17,360
to kill him for you?

50
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,240
That brat

51
00:02:19,590 --> 00:02:21,120
is completely heartless!

52
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,310
He deserves to die.

53
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:34,590
No need.

54
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:36,750
But...

55
00:02:37,150 --> 00:02:38,150
I know he hates me.

56
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:39,910
Zhao Feiyang,

57
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,280
one day,

58
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:43,630
you'll see that I meant well.

59
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:49,360
Thank you for granting me
the divine-grade Dao Bone.

60
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,120
From this day forth,

61
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:53,590
I stand with the Heavenly Sword Sect
through life and death!

62
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:54,960
Holy Maiden,

63
00:02:55,630 --> 00:02:56,430
you're too kind.

64
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,280
By the way,

65
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:58,910
would you be willing

66
00:02:58,910 --> 00:03:01,870
to be a guest elder of our sect?

67
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,120
An invitation from you

68
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,430
would be an honor.

69
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,030
I accept.

70
00:03:15,590 --> 00:03:17,310
(What a performance, Chen Qiushui!)

71
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,960
(You had a hand
in what happened to Bai.)

72
00:03:20,470 --> 00:03:21,360
(Once I recover,)

73
00:03:21,710 --> 00:03:23,150
(you'll be the first to answer for it!)

74
00:03:27,750 --> 00:03:28,400
Brat,

75
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,190
you'd better not leave
the Heavenly Sword Sect.

76
00:03:31,470 --> 00:03:32,030
Otherwise,

77
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,800
you're dead!

78
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:39,360
Sect Master,

79
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:42,240
he's as stubborn as a mule

80
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,430
and twice as unpleasant!

81
00:03:45,710 --> 00:03:46,910
Exactly, Sect Master.

82
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,430
Someone who can't cultivate

83
00:03:48,710 --> 00:03:50,000
with his meridians shattered

84
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:51,190
is nothing

85
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:53,120
but a waste of our resources here.

86
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,190
Just now,

87
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,750
he even humiliated the Holy Maiden
in public

88
00:03:56,030 --> 00:03:57,150
and now the Holy Son holds
a grudge against him.

89
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,800
Isn't he putting our sect

90
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,280
in a difficult position?

91
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:01,430
Sect Master,

92
00:04:02,150 --> 00:04:04,560
I suggest we expel him from the sect!

93
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,400
Same here. Expel him.

94
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:08,590
Expel him!

95
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,000
Expel him!

96
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:11,430
Expel him!

97
00:04:11,750 --> 00:04:12,800
Expel him!

98
00:04:13,030 --> 00:04:14,030
Expel him!

99
00:04:14,430 --> 00:04:15,470
Expel him!

100
00:04:15,710 --> 00:04:16,800
Expel him!

101
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:18,240
Expel him!

102
00:04:20,430 --> 00:04:21,480
We can't do this!

103
00:04:27,270 --> 00:04:28,240
What do you mean?

104
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:31,160
Senior Brother Zhao was once
our sect's chief disciple.

105
00:04:31,310 --> 00:04:32,750
He did so much for the sect,

106
00:04:32,870 --> 00:04:34,920
making it one of the three great sects

107
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:35,950
in the Southern Domain
of Shenwu Continent.

108
00:04:37,270 --> 00:04:38,430
Now that he's down,

109
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,720
we're just going to cast him aside?

110
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,360
Isn't that going too far?

111
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,720
That was then.

112
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,190
This is now.

113
00:04:47,630 --> 00:04:48,950
It's true he did a lot for the sect.

114
00:04:49,390 --> 00:04:50,870
But now he's offended too many people.

115
00:04:51,310 --> 00:04:52,390
The sect has supported him
for three years.

116
00:04:52,510 --> 00:04:53,600
We've already done more than enough.

117
00:04:54,390 --> 00:04:55,720
There's no need to continue.

118
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:56,480
Yes.

119
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:57,360
According to the sect rules,

120
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,830
if an outer disciple
or servant disciple

121
00:04:59,950 --> 00:05:02,070
fails to become a warrior
within three years,

122
00:05:02,270 --> 00:05:03,480
they will be expelled from the sect.

123
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:05,040
The three years are up.

124
00:05:05,190 --> 00:05:07,160
It's only reasonable to make him leave.

125
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,360
But...

126
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:11,830
Zhao Feiyang,

127
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,480
do you have anything to say?

128
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,240
Leave at once!

129
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,750
Who says I'm not a warrior?

130
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:20,120
Who says I can't cultivate?

131
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:21,360
What do you mean?

132
00:05:22,070 --> 00:05:23,510
Everyone knows what happened to you.

133
00:05:23,870 --> 00:05:25,680
No Dao Bone, shattered meridians.

134
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,120
How could you possibly cultivate?

135
00:05:27,750 --> 00:05:28,950
How could you become a warrior?

136
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:35,270
Open your eyes and see for yourself.

137
00:05:39,700 --> 00:05:42,340
♪Through the endless night,
I won't give in♪

138
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:46,460
♪Boots worn through,
blood stains the mountains♪

139
00:05:50,140 --> 00:05:50,980
(Body Tempering Realm, Stage 1)

140
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:53,340
♪A legend in the making♪

141
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:56,980
♪My blood runs hot♪

142
00:05:57,860 --> 00:05:59,500
♪I never lose a fight♪

143
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:02,200
♪I rise against the odds♪

144
00:06:02,270 --> 00:06:02,720
That's...

145
00:06:03,510 --> 00:06:04,600
That's spiritual energy!

146
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,000
How...

147
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,390
How is this possible?

148
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,310
It really is spiritual energy.

149
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:13,800
He has a Dao Bone now.

150
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:14,950
He can cultivate again.

151
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,240
How is this possible?

152
00:06:17,090 --> 00:06:18,050
Oh my!

153
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:18,800
Well...

154
00:06:19,510 --> 00:06:22,310
He really does have a Dao Bone.

155
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:25,600
(Body Tempering Realm, Stage 1)
But why can't we tell its grade?

156
00:06:25,750 --> 00:06:27,160
It must be an unranked Dao Bone

157
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,630
he got by sheer luck.

158
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:31,800
That's why we can't tell its grade.

159
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:35,270
Stage 1 of the Body Tempering Realm.

160
00:06:35,750 --> 00:06:36,830
His cultivation is very low,

161
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:39,040
but he has indeed become a warrior.

162
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,270
He can cultivate again.

163
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,390
Sect Master, this is good news.

164
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,160
Indeed, it is good news.

165
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:46,240
After all, he was once

166
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,600
our chief disciple.

167
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:48,630
Sect Master,

168
00:06:49,070 --> 00:06:50,240
do you really wish to keep him?

169
00:06:50,630 --> 00:06:52,000
He may be able to cultivate now,

170
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,040
but what he has

171
00:06:53,430 --> 00:06:55,190
is only an unranked Dao Bone.

172
00:06:55,510 --> 00:06:57,720
And he's already past
his prime cultivation age.

173
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:59,190
His prospects are bleak.

174
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,360
What good will it do to keep him?

175
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:03,240
But rules cannot be bent.

176
00:07:03,630 --> 00:07:05,270
Zhao Feiyang has become a warrior.

177
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,240
Hasn't he?

178
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,240
Yes.

179
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:08,830
In that case,

180
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:11,480
he doesn't have to leave.

181
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,160
Zhao Feiyang.

182
00:07:16,830 --> 00:07:17,360
Sect Master.

183
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,310
Congratulations on your breakthrough
and return to cultivation!

184
00:07:19,830 --> 00:07:21,510
You've contributed greatly to the sect,

185
00:07:21,950 --> 00:07:23,630
but that's all in the past now.

186
00:07:23,950 --> 00:07:26,240
The sect can't keep supporting you
unconditionally.

187
00:07:26,510 --> 00:07:28,360
You have to rise on your own.

188
00:07:28,630 --> 00:07:31,120
Tomorrow is the trial
for outer disciples.

189
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,430
If you pass the trial,

190
00:07:33,750 --> 00:07:35,870
you will be a formal disciple again

191
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:38,920
and receive the same cultivation
resources as other formal disciples.

192
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,560
Thank you, Sect Master.

193
00:07:44,390 --> 00:07:45,120
Dismissed.

194
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:57,870
Zhao Feiyang.

195
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:08,000
This is an Essence Nurturing Pill
I refined myself.

196
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:10,430
It contains at least
a hundred units of spiritual energy.

197
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:13,360
If you can cultivate again,

198
00:08:13,750 --> 00:08:15,040
this will be useful to you.

199
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:17,720
Why him?

200
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,190
Elder Murong is treating him
way too well.

201
00:08:19,510 --> 00:08:20,120
Exactly.

202
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:22,040
What makes him so special?

203
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,310
(I don't like owing anyone a favor.)

204
00:08:26,950 --> 00:08:27,950
(But refusing in public)

205
00:08:28,390 --> 00:08:29,830
(would embarrass Elder Murong.)

206
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:31,830
Thank you, Elder Murong.

207
00:08:36,030 --> 00:08:37,550
(Once I become a formal disciple,)

208
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:39,000
(I can enter the Alchemy Hall)

209
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,510
(and repair all my meridians.)

210
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:43,240
(My return to my former peak
will be within reach.)

211
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:45,750
Congrats, Senior Brother Zhao!

212
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,150
You get to stay after all.

213
00:08:49,510 --> 00:08:50,120
Thank you

214
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,390
for speaking up for me.

215
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:55,550
You used to look out for me.

216
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:58,000
It was only right
that I spoke up for you.

217
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,960
The disciple trial is tomorrow.

218
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,150
You've been here for three years, right?

219
00:09:05,910 --> 00:09:06,790
Yes.

220
00:09:07,390 --> 00:09:08,080
I...

221
00:09:08,910 --> 00:09:11,480
Looks like I may have to leave.

222
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,480
(Inside this sect,)

223
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:15,790
(few people would stand up for me.)

224
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,480
(If she goes,)

225
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:19,000
(I'd be losing)

226
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,390
(one of the only friends I have.)

227
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,440
Senior Brother Zhao,
what are you doing?

228
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:27,550
This Essence Nurturing Pill
may help you.

229
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,270
There's still some time

230
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,240
before tomorrow's trial.

231
00:09:30,670 --> 00:09:31,960
Absorb and refine it now.

232
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,630
Becoming a warrior should be easy.

233
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:36,510
But it's a gift from Elder Murong.

234
00:09:36,790 --> 00:09:38,030
It's so precious.

235
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,440
How could I take it?

236
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:40,600
I can't.

237
00:09:40,910 --> 00:09:42,030
Just take it.

238
00:09:50,750 --> 00:09:52,750
No one's ever treated me this well.

239
00:09:53,670 --> 00:09:54,360
Senior Brother Zhao,

240
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,790
how can I ever repay you?

241
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:58,910
We're fellow disciples.

242
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:00,320
Don't be so formal.

243
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:07,840
Senior Brother Zhao,

244
00:10:08,910 --> 00:10:10,080
actually...

245
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,510
actually...

246
00:10:13,670 --> 00:10:15,320
there's something I want to tell you.

247
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:16,630
Go ahead.

248
00:10:18,030 --> 00:10:19,240
Actually,

249
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:20,600
I...

250
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,270
I like you.

251
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:27,030
I've liked you ever since

252
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,440
I first came here three years ago.

253
00:10:28,870 --> 00:10:30,440
I just never had the courage to say it.

254
00:10:30,910 --> 00:10:32,080
But today,

255
00:10:32,750 --> 00:10:33,960
I've decided to tell you

256
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:34,870
since

257
00:10:35,270 --> 00:10:37,550
you gave me something so precious.

258
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,670
Doesn't that

259
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,320
also mean...

260
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,440
that you have feelings for me?

261
00:10:46,030 --> 00:10:46,910
(Such an innocent girl.)

262
00:10:47,670 --> 00:10:48,960
(I have too much on my shoulders,)

263
00:10:49,630 --> 00:10:51,360
(or else I might not turn her down.)

264
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,150
Cuihua,

265
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,600
I only care about you

266
00:11:02,630 --> 00:11:04,200
as a fellow disciple.

267
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:08,440
If we mixed other feelings into it,

268
00:11:08,550 --> 00:11:09,480
it'd get complicated.

269
00:11:11,270 --> 00:11:11,910
Besides,

270
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,720
revenge is all I care about now.

271
00:11:14,670 --> 00:11:17,550
I've got no room for anything else.

272
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:20,390
So let's talk about it later.

273
00:11:20,870 --> 00:11:21,440
I have something to do.

274
00:11:22,030 --> 00:11:22,630
I'll be going.

275
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:24,510
Zhao Feiyang!

276
00:11:28,790 --> 00:11:30,480
Is it because I'm ugly?

277
00:11:31,030 --> 00:11:32,440
Or because I'm a nobody?

278
00:11:33,270 --> 00:11:34,510
You can just say so.

279
00:11:34,510 --> 00:11:36,030
Don't make up strange excuses

280
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:37,320
to spare my feelings.

281
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:38,600
That's not it.

282
00:11:38,750 --> 00:11:39,480
It's not?

283
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:40,670
How is it not?

284
00:11:40,870 --> 00:11:42,510
You even turned down
the Holy Maiden of Tianxuan Kingdom

285
00:11:42,510 --> 00:11:43,600
in public,

286
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,630
let alone a nobody like me.

287
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,030
That's not true at all.

288
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,240
You've got it wrong, Cuihua.

289
00:11:49,510 --> 00:11:50,080
Take it back.

290
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:51,960
I don't need your pity!

291
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:55,870
Cuihua,

292
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,000
you're mistaken.

293
00:11:57,630 --> 00:11:59,390
I don't look down on you at all.

294
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:00,550
Also,

295
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,910
I've already given it to you.

296
00:12:03,510 --> 00:12:04,750
I won't take it back.

297
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:23,240
Zhao Feiyang,

298
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:25,630
I'll impress you!

299
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:51,020
(Honglian Sword Immortal,
Sword Immortal Island)

300
00:12:57,260 --> 00:12:58,620
(Penglai Sword Immortal,
Sword Immortal Island)

301
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:06,460
(Canglan Sword Immortal,
Sword Immortal Island)

302
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:08,440
(The Three Sword Immortals!)

303
00:13:11,140 --> 00:13:14,930
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

304
00:13:15,180 --> 00:13:17,330
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

305
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:21,450
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

306
00:13:21,580 --> 00:13:26,010
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

307
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:29,330
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

308
00:13:30,170 --> 00:13:32,840
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

309
00:13:33,060 --> 00:13:36,460
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

310
00:13:36,540 --> 00:13:40,270
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

311
00:13:41,140 --> 00:13:44,310
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

312
00:13:44,580 --> 00:13:47,700
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

313
00:13:48,500 --> 00:13:51,020
♪With this flesh and soul♪

314
00:13:51,340 --> 00:13:54,570
♪I shall forge a new age♪

315
00:13:54,780 --> 00:13:57,650
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

316
00:13:58,020 --> 00:14:01,110
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

317
00:14:01,330 --> 00:14:03,970
♪At cultivation's peak♪

318
00:14:03,980 --> 00:14:07,330
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

319
00:14:08,100 --> 00:14:10,810
♪The sun and moon turn♪

320
00:14:10,810 --> 00:14:14,330
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

321
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:21,310
♪I am the undying flame♪

322
00:14:22,300 --> 00:14:26,970
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

323
00:14:27,230 --> 00:14:30,330
♪At last I see, immortality♪

324
00:14:30,780 --> 00:14:35,470
♪Lives in your smiles.♪
